<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-11T06:51:27.880Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 06:51:27 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces have launched missiles and ground attacks on Haitian gang hideouts, destroying the headquarters of the 400-member Mawozo gang and killing about 20 gang members. Haitian gang leader Mathias Saintil was killed in the strikes, and the Salvadoran president warned remaining gang leaders of further action. Haitian officials are traveling to El Salvador to discuss the future of the Salvadoran offensive, while Amnesty International has called for transparency on the deployment terms. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvg2xdwnwezo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168782&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFBxNGhVRmFMcmI1eEcySGNSbEtVeUxwc2RZbUdPZW96N2tycGZzblZHSVZ2bklralR2cnE1bTJRaGtnaHhXRXBPUUo2TmFoRHJwTEZnNmtQcXVhdWpFNnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/americas/20261111-haiti-pm-bukele-salvadoran-troops-gang-headquarters&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxPTE1udUxpSFA1ODcxYlRXWXBVa2JXTFVOSWFSYWU1aHVnbzNKdHhHX3hLU1pPMnlYNG1nLXhqYVRaV3U1aDJ6dzZaNHowa2pOTzNJX2ZyNTlpV1VZQVVyQzNfOHpfWHBOM2JnMU4xSUkxZlowLXNmWXZRcXFBMzlzRXNUOE41aDVNZlF1Vl9tZURVMWs2a1FVVDVsXzJBX0NpdGFfYk9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQTzM1SUxvakZDNV9scm9PYXg4bDVJOE5BZnI1dFlqZ3p5cG1oTVVFNHFWcTQ1N1c3enhQWGU5Ym5uNzd0NjBWbmlxU1ZsOHlaRnI3Qko5dFFzbXcyY3l2N3AxZl9faldvOUJl